@page "/articles"
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@inject NavigationManager navigationManager
<div class="container">
    <div class="row mb-3" style="background-color: #f7f7f7;">
        <div class="col" >
            <h1 id="top">Articles</h1>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mb-3 pt-3" style="background-color: #f7f7f7;">
        <div class="col" >
            <article>
                <h3 id="matTool">MAT Tool - Miscellaneous Administrative Tasks</h3>
                <p>I am the sole maintainer of an app written many years ago for the service desk.</p>
                <p>It allows them to perform certain tasks like adding new users to varuous applications.</p>
                <p>I have extended the functionality over the years, adding tabs to allow them to do additional tasks. This involves work in VB and  SQL Server.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mb-3 pt-3" style="background-color: #f7f7f7;">
        <div class="col" >
            <article>
                <h3 id="secondment2023">Secondment 2023-2024</h3>
                <p>I spent a day a week for about a year in 2023/2024 working with a development team as a developer.</p>
                <p>I worked on various systems analysing and fixing issues. </p>
                <p>I had some substantial coding experiance to the end of this time on a rewrite of an application in C#.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mb-3 pt-3" style="background-color: #f7f7f7;">
        <div class="col" >
            <article>
                <h3 id="secondment2018">Secondment 2018</h3>
                <p>
                    I spent 3 months with a development team in 2018 working on small development requirements.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mb-3 pt-3" style="background-color: #f7f7f7;">
        <div class="col" >
            <article>
                <h3 id="dailyWork">Daily work</h3>
                <p>On a daily basis I interact with the code base in Azure DevOps. </p>
                <p>Many incidents require reading through code and debugging it to resolve issues.</p>
                <p>On ocasion I have the oportunity to make small code changes which require going througn the entire life cycle of a change from requirement specing to development, testing and deployment. </p>
                <p>It also required working closely with various dev teams organising environements and with the business to confirm the issue has been resolved.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mb-3">
        <div class="col-8">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="() => ReturnButton()">Return to home</button>
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 mt-1">
            <a href="articles#top">Back To top</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@code {

    private void ReturnButton() => navigationManager!.NavigateTo("/");

}
